      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thanks for the feedback!\n\nWe are not going to add ambisonic support at this time. If it turns out this is a widely used feature and heavily requested, we can revisit! \n\nAs a workaround, the Oculus scripts are whitelisted in VRChat so the Oculus Ambisonic script can be used in a world.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
