      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c62e995865713647a7115b|full_name}: Thank you for keeping the scripts whitelisted, this would have broken some audio in my current world in development otherwise. :) Really hope y'all consider adding support in the near future! It's a great alternative to creating an array of point sources (or worse, 2D head-locked audio) for ambience/music. I'd happily put together some tutorials on authoring custom ambisonics for worlds out of existing stereo/mono audio clips if this gets added natively.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
